{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/577576-beast-cramped-lair-trait","id":577576,"title":"[Beast] Cramped lair trait","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-03T12:02:39-07:00","id":577576,"title":"[Beast] Cramped lair trait","content":"Hi all,<br /> <br /> Been reading the lair traits for Beast and it looks like cramped was...weirdly written. Were it just me I'd have gone with something like &quot;[Size of character] - [Chosen size] as penalties&quot; rather than applying the penalties to everyone, because it basically states that a kid in a cramped space will have the same problems as a Giant. Also, why would anyone choose anything other than &quot;1&quot; from a mechanical perspective? If his Dragon can crawl in rat-holes, it's self-nerfing (even though really gamey) not to take creatures of size 1 as the targeted size.<br /> <br /> Mind, I'm not saying everyone will, but the power of this particular trait seems rather...weird. I went with size 4 because my character has Small-Framed so it fits, but still...I might as well say that in his lair he's able to crawl in every tiny hole and apply bigger penalties to the Heroes attacking me...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T13:00:30-07:00","id":577642,"title":"","content":"I would still apply it due to the fact that your a dream like area meaning that regardless of what size you are you will always be cramped penalties still apply the because if say a anakim were to take this he could easily move through the cramped area no penalties your in his nightmare lair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":893,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","user":"reaperfrost8","date":".  sorry for bad writting useing a phone 07-03-2015, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T20:16:44-07:00","id":578081,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnum Opus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/577576-beast-cramped-lair-trait#post577576\" rel=\"nofollo